  "objects": [
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 2,
      "text": [
        "The counter, and the tariff, which is by the week and not by the night.",
        "Nobody stays in Aureline for one night. It is not that kind of city.",
        "The sign over the door says THE LONG WAIT and is a joke about the rail."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 7,
      "y": 1,
      "text": [
        "A shelf of left-behind books, free to take, free to bring back.",
        "Three of them are the same flood pamphlet from the station bookstall.",
        "Somebody has read one of the three all the way through. Only one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 7,
      "text": [
        "The good chairs by the fire, and an unwritten rule about who gets them",
        "that nobody in this room could put into words",
        "but which has never once been broken."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 11,
      "y": 7,
      "text": [
        "A table under the window with a chessboard on it, mid-game, unattended.",
        "A card weighted down with a mug: DO NOT MOVE. HE COMES BACK THURSDAYS.",
        "It is not Thursday."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 1,
      "y": 11,
      "text": [
        "Beds in the common room, curtained off, at half the price of a room.",
        "Sixteen of them, all made, all taken by nightfall.",
        "This is what most people can afford in the capital and it is not a scandal here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 11,
      "text": [
        "A board of notes pinned by people looking for other people.",
        "WORK WANTED. ROOM WANTED. CAME UP FROM THE COAST, HAVE NOT FOUND HIM.",
        "Some of the notes are years old. Nobody takes any of them down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "hiddenItem",
      "x": 18,
      "y": 10,
